1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,938
Yangi gaz koni topildi.

2
00:00:02,138 --> 00:00:03,038
Yana bittasi.

3
00:00:03,238 --> 00:00:07,412
Lekin qish kelsa — uyda gaz bosimi tushadi, zapravkada navbat.

4
00:00:07,612 --> 00:00:09,920
Gaz topilyapti-yu, nega yetmayapti?

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,427
Keling, raqamlar bilan tekshiramiz.

6
00:00:12,977 --> 00:00:16,540
Sentabrda Qashqadaryoda «Patron» degan yangi kon topildi.

7
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,665
Zaxirasi — taxminan 2,5 milliard kub metr.

8
00:00:19,865 --> 00:00:20,765
Ko‘p tuyuladi.

9
00:00:20,965 --> 00:00:24,277
Lekin qishda mamlakat bir kunda qancha gaz sarflaydi?

10
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:26,040
Taxminan 154 million kub.

11
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,860
Demak, bu kon butun O‘zbekistonga atigi 16 kunga yetadi.

12
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,780
Gap shundaki, eski konlar tugayapti.

13
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:37,162
Energetika vaziri aytishicha, konlarning 85 foizi qurib bormoqda.

14
00:00:37,362 --> 00:00:40,675
2019-yilda 60 milliard kubdan ko‘p gaz qazib olingan.

15
00:00:40,875 --> 00:00:43,242
2025-yilda esa — atigi 42 milliard.

16
00:00:43,443 --> 00:00:45,943
Olti yilda deyarli uchdan biri yo‘qoldi.

17
00:00:46,493 --> 00:00:51,330
Yangi konlar ham bor: Mo‘ynoqdagi ikki quduq kuniga 3 million kub beryapti.

18
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,960
Patron qudug‘i — yana yarim million.

19
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:57,973
Ammo 2026-yil birinchi chorakda qazib olish 15 foizga tushdi.

20
00:00:58,173 --> 00:01:00,985
Bu kuniga taxminan 19 million kub kam degani.

21
00:01:01,185 --> 00:01:04,373
Ya’ni topganimizdan besh barobar ko‘p yo‘qotyapmiz.

22
00:01:04,923 --> 00:01:07,048
Bu orada aholi 38 milliondan oshdi

23
00:01:07,248 --> 00:01:10,123
va har yili yana 685 ming kishiga ko‘payyapti.

24
00:01:10,323 --> 00:01:15,488
Uylar, zavodlar, metan mashinalar, elektr stansiyalar — hammasi shu gazda.

25
00:01:15,688 --> 00:01:19,375
Qishda gaz avval aholiga va elektr stansiyalariga beriladi.

26
00:01:19,925 --> 00:01:21,793
Yana bir teshik — quvurlar.

27
00:01:21,993 --> 00:01:26,175
2026-yilning birinchi yarmida tarmoqlarda 7,6 foiz gaz yo‘qolgan.

28
00:01:26,375 --> 00:01:27,805
Bu 797 million kub —

29
00:01:28,005 --> 00:01:30,685
Patron konining uchdan biri — olti oyda.

30
00:01:31,235 --> 00:01:34,855
Natijada, gaz sotgan O‘zbekiston endi gaz sotib olyapti.

31
00:01:35,055 --> 00:01:38,480
2023-yildan beri — Rossiyadan, Qozog‘iston orqali.

32
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,988
2025-yilda 6,5 milliard kub olindi.

33
00:01:41,188 --> 00:01:45,243
2026-yil birinchi chorakda importga 360 million dollar ketdi —

34
00:01:45,443 --> 00:01:47,625
o‘tgan yilgidan 2,2 barobar ko‘p.

35
00:01:48,175 --> 00:01:50,108
Demak, gaz topilmayapti emas.

36
00:01:50,308 --> 00:01:52,925
Topilgani — tugayotganini qoplamayapti.

37
00:01:53,125 --> 00:01:57,370
Hukumat ham 2030-yil rejasini 62 dan 48,5 milliard kubga tushirdi.

38
00:01:57,570 --> 00:02:01,713
Endi savol: qancha topamiz emas — qanchasini isrof qilmaymiz?

39
00:02:01,913 --> 00:02:05,780
Bunday hisob-kitoblarni o‘tkazib yubormang — obuna bo‘ling.
